			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Convert composter to be mono audio, fixes #29 \n* EI's Tesla Tower's sound now originates from the top rather than the controller\n* Added sounds to all boilers, turbines, and diesel generators, closes #14 \n* Added functionality to add custom sounds to custom added MI generators through KubeJS (Check the wiki!)\n* Add sounds for applying Redstone Control Modules and Overdrive Modules to machines\n* Fixed the wrench no longer making a sound after previous patch\n* Added YAI! compat\n* Updated mod dependencies\n* Moved MI mixins to their own package\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TheStaticVoid/MI-Sound-Addon/compare/1.3.0-1.21.1...1.3.1-1.21.1"
		},
