			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fix #23: Add namespaces to registered sound events by @Swedz in https://github.com/TheStaticVoid/MI-Sound-Addon/pull/25\n* Fix machines added by addons not getting sounds registered anymore by @Swedz in https://github.com/TheStaticVoid/MI-Sound-Addon/pull/24\n* Added sounds to Extended Industrialization singleblock machines and the Tesla Coil / Tesla Tower\n* Added sounds to the Industrialization Overdrive Pyrolyse Oven\n* Adding upgrades to machines now makes a noise\n* Using a pipe config card to store / change pipe settings now makes a noise\n* Using a wrench to change the orientation of a machine now makes a noise\n* Fixed volume settings in the config never being set on load\n* Cleaned up the code a bit\n\n## Note to pack devs\nSounds now are associated to their namespaces, please check the wiki for the updated method of adding custom sounds\n\n## New Contributors\n* @Swedz made their first contribution in https://github.com/TheStaticVoid/MI-Sound-Addon/pull/25\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/TheStaticVoid/MI-Sound-Addon/compare/1.2.0-1.21.1...1.3.0-1.21.1"
		},
